
<!-- saved from url=(0088)https://trailtool.org/Admin/pages/forms/examples/firstscreen.php?sname=evaluationtrail01 -->
<html><head><title>Evaluation and its importance</title><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">You’ve</span><span style="margin: 0px"> reached the top—</span><span style="margin: 0px">the final result</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of the project. Now </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> time to return to the valley. </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">During</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> return, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">evaluate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Evaluation is a </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">which</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">systematically</span><span style="margin: 0px"> collect, </span><span style="margin: 0px">analyze</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">interpret</span><span style="margin: 0px"> information </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">assess</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">value</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">effectiveness</span><span style="margin: 0px">, or </span><span style="margin: 0px">quality</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> of </span><span style="margin: 0px">something</span><span style="margin: 0px"> (</span><span style="margin: 0px">Scriven</span><span style="margin: 0px">, 1967).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Evaluation helps you </span><span style="margin: 0px">identify</span><span style="margin: 0px"> the strengths and weaknesses of your transdisciplinary education journey and propose improvements.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> It </span><span style="margin: 0px">also</span><span style="margin: 0px"> supports accountability </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">what</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ve</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">done</span><span style="margin: 0px"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px">achieved</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">strengthening</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> trust of </span><span style="margin: 0px">your</span><span style="margin: 0px"> stakeholders.</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Moreover</span><span style="margin: 0px">, a </span><span style="margin: 0px">good</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">provides</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">insight</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">into</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">areas</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">where</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">participants</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">still</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">grow</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">develop</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">How </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> start </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px">?</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> On </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">practice</span><span style="margin: 0px"> page</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ll</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">find</span><span style="margin: 0px"> information </span><span style="margin: 0px">about</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">PDCA </span><span style="margin: 0px">cycle</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">—a classic, practical </span><span style="margin: 0px">evaluation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> tool.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Reference:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span></font></p><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Scriven</span><span style="margin: 0px">, M. (1967). </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">The </span><span style="margin: 0px">Methodology</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of Evaluation</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">. In: R. W. Tyler, R. M. </span><span style="margin: 0px">Gagne</span><span style="margin: 0px">, &amp; M. </span><span style="margin: 0px">Scriven</span><span style="margin: 0px"> (Eds.), </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Perspectives</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of Curriculum Evaluation</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">, Chicago (pp. 39–83). Rand </span><span style="margin: 0px">McNally</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div></body></html>